return ['domain'=>'zinn-chat','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-chat','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-29T17:24:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-29T17:24:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-chat','A complete help desk and AI assistant that runs on your own WordPress: an AI that answers from your own pages with links, live chat, and support tickets in wp-admin, on a submit-a-ticket page and in the WooCommerce account area. Under 10 KB on the page and no requests at all until a visitor opens it.'=>'To\'liq yordam markazi va o\'zingizning WordPress\'ingizda ishlaydigan sun\'iy intellekt yordamchisi: havolalar bilan o\'z sahifalaringizdan javob beradigan sun\'iy intellekt, wp-admin\'da, so\'rov yuborish sahifasida va WooCommerce hisob maydonida jonli chat hamda qo\'llab-quvvatlash chiptalari. Sahifada 10 KB dan kam va tashrif buyuruvchi uni ochmaguncha umuman so\'rovlar yuborilmaydi.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Inbox'=>'Kirish qutisi','Tickets'=>'Chiptalar','Assistant'=>'Yordamchi','Settings'=>'Sozlamalar','Setup'=>'O‘rnatish','Zinn® Chat could not create its database tables:'=>'Zinn® Chat o\'z ma\'lumotlar bazasi jadvallarini yarata olmadi:','The AI assistant could not answer a visitor:'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt yordamchisi tashrif buyuruvchining savoliga javob bera olmadi:','Fix it'=>'Tuzatish','Loading…'=>'Yuklanmoqda…','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Bu ekran uchun JavaScript kerak.','Chat'=>'Chat','AI assistant'=>'AI yordamchisi','Tickets and email'=>'Chiptalar va elektron pochta','Site index'=>'Sayt indeksi','Privacy and spam'=>'Maxfiylik va spam','Connect to Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital® ga ulanish','Show the chat on the site'=>'Saytda chatni ko\'rsatish','Nothing appears on the site, and nothing is loaded, until this is ticked.'=>'Bu belgilanmaguncha saytda hech narsa ko\'rinmaydi va hech narsa yuklanmaydi.','Chat title'=>'Chat sarlavhasi','Greeting'=>'Salomlashish','The first thing a visitor sees.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchi ko\'radigan birinchi narsa.','Greeting when nobody can answer'=>'Hech kim javob bera olmagandagi salomlashish','Colour'=>'Rang','Text colour on the colour'=>'Ranglar palitrasidagi matn rangi','Position'=>'O\'rni','Bottom, end side (right in left-to-right languages)'=>'Pastki, oxirgi tomon (chapdan o\'ngga yoziladigan tillarda o\'ngda)','Bottom, start side'=>'Pastki, boshlanish tomoni','Offer "Talk to a person"'=>'"Mutaxassis bilan gaplashish" taklifi','Shown while somebody has the Inbox open and is not set to away.'=>'Kimdir Xabarlar qutisini ochib turgan va "ketganman" deb belgilanmagan vaqtda ko\'rsatiladi.','Hide the chat from your support team while they are signed in'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash jamoasi tizimga kirgan paytda chatni ulardan yashirish','Show "Powered by Zinn® Chat" under the chat'=>'Chat ostida "Powered by Zinn® Chat" yozuvini ko‘rsatish','Optional. Off unless you turn it on.'=>'Ixtiyoriy. Siz yoqmaguningizcha o\'chirilgan holatda bo\'ladi.','Let the AI assistant answer visitors'=>'AI yordamchisiga tashrif buyuruvchilarga javob berishiga ruxsat bering','Assistant name'=>'Yordamchi nomi','Extra instructions for the assistant'=>'Yordamchi uchun qo\'shimcha ko\'rsatmalar','For example: "Always mention our 30-day returns." They cannot override the safety rules.'=>'Masalan: "Har doim 30 kunlik qaytarish siyosatimizni eslatib o\'ting." Ular xavfsizlik qoidalarini bekor qila olmaydi.','Answer language'=>'Javob tili','"auto" answers in the visitor\'s own language; or a locale such as en_GB or de_DE to always answer in one language.'=>'"auto" tashrif buyuruvchining o\'z tilida javob beradi; yoki har doim bitta tilda javob berish uchun en_GB yoki de_DE kabi til muhiti.','Minimum relevance'=>'Minimal dolzarblik','Passages scoring below this (0 to 0.95) are not used, and the assistant says it does not know. Check scores in the test console.'=>'Ushbu ko‘rsatkichdan past ball olgan (0 dan 0.95 gacha) parchalar ishlatilmaydi va yordamchi matnni bilmasligini bildiradi. Sinov konsolidagi ballarni tekshiring.','Offer a person after this many unanswered questions'=>'Javobsiz qolgan shuncha savoldan keyin foydalanuvchiga taklif qilish','Longest answer (tokens)'=>'Eng uzun javob (tokenlar)','Accept support tickets'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash so\'rovlarini qabul qilish','Support page'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash sahifasi','The page with the [zinn_chat_support] shortcode or the Support page block. Ticket links in emails open this page.'=>'[zinn_chat_support] shorkodi yoki Qo‘llab-quvvatlash sahifasi bloki mavjud bo‘lgan sahifa. Emaillardagi savol-javob havolalari ushbu sahifani ochadi.','Send team alerts to'=>'Jamoa ogohlantirishlarini yuborish','One or more email addresses, separated by commas. Empty: the site admin email.'=>'Verguliar bilan ajratilgan bir yoki bir nechta elektron pochta manzillari. Bo\'sh: sayt ma\'muri elektron pochtasi.','Sender name on emails'=>'Xabarlardagi jo‘natuvchi nomi','Email the team when a visitor waits for a person longer than (minutes)'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchi xodimni quyidagi vaqtdan (daqiqa) ko\'proq kutganda jamoaga xat yuborish','Private ticket links work for (days after the last message)'=>'Maxfiy chipta havolalari (oxirgi xabardan keyingi kunlar) uchun ishlaydi','After that the page offers to email a new link.'=>'Shundan so\'ng sahifa yangi havolani elektron pochta orqali yuborishni taklif qiladi.','Add a Support tab to the WooCommerce account area'=>'WooCommerce hisoblar maydoniga Qo‘llab-quvvatlash yorlig‘ini qo‘shish','Let the assistant tell signed-in customers about their own orders'=>'Tizimga kirgan mijozlarga yordamchiga o\'z buyurtmalari haqida gapirishiga ruxsat bering','Answers "where is my order?" from the order status and tracking.'=>'Buyurtma holati va kuzatuvi orqali "buyurtmam qayerda?" degan savolga javob beradi.','Content the assistant reads'=>'Yordamchi o‘qiydigan kontent','None ticked means every public type.'=>'Hech biri belgilanmagan bo‘lsa, barcha ommaviy turlar nazarda tutiladi.','WooCommerce products, prices, stock, shipping and payment methods'=>'WooCommerce mahsulotlari, narxlari, zaxirasi, yetkazib berish va toʻlov usullari','Forums (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)'=>'Forumlar (bbPress, BuddyBoss, wpForo)','Read pages as visitors see them when a page builder\'s content cannot be read directly'=>'Sahifa yaratuvchining tarkibini to\'g\'ridan-to\'g\'ri o\'qib bo\'lmaganda, sahifalarni tashrif buyuruvchilar ko\'radigan holatda o\'qing','Fetches the page from your own site in the background.'=>'Sahifani fonda o\'z saytingizdan yuklab oladi.','Never read these posts or pages (IDs)'=>'Hech qachon bu xabarlarni yoki sahifalarni o\'qitmang (ID\'lar)','Comma-separated.'=>'Vergul bilan ajratilgan.','Ask visitors to agree before a chat or ticket'=>'Chat yoki tiketdan oldin tashrif buyuruvchilardan rozilik olishni so\'rang','Agreement text'=>'Kelishuv matni','Privacy policy link'=>'Maxfiylik siyosati havolasi','Empty: the site\'s privacy policy page.'=>'Bo\'sh: saytning maxfiylik siyosati sahifasi.','Delete finished chats and tickets after (days)'=>'Yakunlangan chatlar va chiptalarni quyidagi muddatdan keyin o\'chirish (kunlar)','0 keeps them.'=>'0 tchtiradi.','Store visitors\' IP addresses'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilarning IP manzillarini saqlash','Off: only a coded form is kept, enough for spam limits.'=>'Oʻchirilgan: faqat kodlangan shakli saqlanadi, bu spam cheklovlari uchun yetarli.','Messages per visitor per hour'=>'Har bir tashrif buyuruvchiga soatiga xabarlar soni','Chats per visitor per day'=>'Har bir tashrif buyuruvchiga kunlik chatlar soni','Tickets per visitor per day'=>'Har bir tashrif buyuruvchiga kuniga chiptalar','Longest chat message (characters)'=>'Eng uzun chat xabari (belgilar)','Block list'=>'Bloklar ro\'yxati','One per line: an IP address, an email address, @domain.com, or a word.'=>'Har bir qatorda bittadan: IP-manzil, elektron pochta manzili, @domain.com yoki so‘z.','Where chats are answered'=>'Chatlar qayerda javob berilishini bildiradi','"This site" keeps everything in this site\'s database and uses your own AI key. "Zinn Digital®" uses the hosted inbox in the Zinn® app (for Zinn® hosting customers).'=>'"Ushbu sayt" ushbu sayt ma\'lumotlar bazasida barcha narsani saqlaydi va o\'zingizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingizdan foydalanadi. "Zinn Digital®" Zinn® ilovasidagi (Zinn® xosting mijozlari uchun) xosting qilingan kirish qutisidan foydalanadi.','This site (recommended)'=>'Ushbu sayt (tavsiya etiladi)','Zinn Digital® app'=>'Zinn Digital® ilovasi','Zinn® widget key'=>'Zinn® vidjet kaliti','From the Zinn® app: Live chat, then your widget. Starts with zc_.'=>'Zinn® ilovasidan: Jonli chat, so\'ngra vidjetingiz. zc_ bilan boshlanadi.','Zinn® Chat settings'=>'Zinn® Chat sozlamalari','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','The assistant uses your own AI key.'=>'Yordamchi o\'zingizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingizdan foydalanadi.','AI providers and models'=>'AI provayderlari va modellari','— None —'=>'— Hech biri —','Saved — leave empty to keep'=>'Saqlangan — saqlab qolish uchun bo\'sh qoldiring','Remove the saved key'=>'Saqlangan kalitni oʻchirish','You are not allowed to change these settings.'=>'Sizga bu sozlamalarni oʻzgartirishga ruxsat berilmagan.','Turn the chat on'=>'Chatni yoqish','The chat is showing on your site.'=>'Chat saytingizda ko\'rsatilmoqda.','Nothing is shown or loaded on your site until you turn it on.'=>'Uni yoqmaguningizcha veb-saytingizda hech narsa ko‘rsatilmaydi yoki yuklanmaydi.','Turn off'=>'O\'chirish','Turn on'=>'Yoqish','Connect your AI provider'=>'Suniy intellekt provayderingizni ulang','Connected. Site search uses %1$s (%2$s).'=>'Ullandi. Sayt boʻyicha qidiruv %1$s (%2$s) dan foydalanmoqda.','Connected. Your provider cannot build a meaning-based index, so the assistant uses keyword search. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key for better answers.'=>'Ulangan. Provayderingiz maʼnoga asoslangan indeks yarata olmaydi, shuning uchun yordamchi kalit soʻzlar boʻyicha qidiruvdan foydalanadi. Yaxshiroq javoblar uchun Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki OpenRouter kalitini qoʻshing.','Add a key for Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter or any OpenAI-compatible service. The newest model is chosen for you; you can change it.'=>'Google Gemini, OpenAI, Anthropic Claude, Mistral, OpenRouter yoki har qanday OpenAI mos keluvchi xizmat uchun kalit qo\'shing. Eng yangi model siz uchun tanlanadi; uni o\'zgartirishingiz mumkin.','AI providers'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt provayderlari','Let the assistant read your site'=>'Yordamchiga saytingizni o\'qishiga ruxsat bering','%1$d pages read, %2$d waiting, %3$d passages. New and edited content is picked up automatically.'=>'%1$d sahifa oʻqildi, %2$d tasi kutilmoqda, %3$d parcha. Yangi va tahrirlangan kontent avtomatik ravishda aniqlanadi.','Read the whole site now'=>'Butun saytni hozir o\'qing','Create your support page'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash sahifasini yaratish','Visitors submit tickets there, and ticket emails link to it.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilar u yerda so\'rovlar yuboradilar va so\'rov xatlari unga havola qiladi.','A page with the ticket form, where customers also follow their requests.'=>'Mijozlar o\'z so\'rovlarini ham kuzatib boradigan, murojaat (ticket) formasi mavjud sahifa.','View'=>'Ko\'rish','Create the support page'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash sahifasini yaratish','Add "Submit a ticket" and "Chat with us" to a menu'=>'Menuga "Murojaat yuborish" va "Biz bilan chat qilish"ni qo\'shish','Appearance, Menus: use the Zinn® Chat box. Or add the Zinn® Chat blocks to any page, in any page builder.'=>'Tashqi koʻrinish, Menyular: Zinn® Chat oynasidan foydalaning. Yoki istalgan sahifa yaratuvchisida istalgan sahifaga Zinn® Chat bloklarini qoʻshing.','Menus'=>'Menyular','WooCommerce account area'=>'WooCommerce hisob qaydnomasi maydoni','Customers see their tickets under Support in My Account, and the assistant can tell them where their order is.'=>'Mijozlar oʻzlarining murojaatlarini "Mening hisobim" boʻlimidagi "Qoʻllab-quvvatlash" ostida koʻrishlari mumkin va yordamchi ularga buyurtmasi qayerda ekanligini ayta oladi.','Test the assistant'=>'Yordamchini sinab ko‘rish','Ask it questions and see exactly which pages it answered from, including out-of-date ones.'=>'Unga savollar bering va u qaysi sahifalardan, jumladan eskirganlaridan javob berganini aniq ko\'ring.','Open the test console'=>'Sinov konsolini ochish','Answer live chats'=>'Jonli chatlarga javob berish','Visitors can ask for a person while you have the Inbox open. It works on a phone too.'=>'Kirish qutisi ochiq paytida tashrif buyuruvchilar boshqa xodim bilan bog‘lanishni so‘rashlari mumkin. Bu telefonda ham ishlaydi.','Open the Inbox'=>'Kirish qutisini ochish','Set up Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat sozlash','This site is connected to the Zinn Digital® app: chats are answered there. To run the help desk on this site instead, choose "This site" under Settings, Connect to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Ushbu sayt Zinn Digital® ilovasiga ulangan: chatlarga o\'sha yerda javob beriladi. Buning o\'rniga ushbu saytda yordam xizmatini ishga tushirish uchun "Sozlamalar" bo\'limidan "Zinn Digital® ga ulash" opsiyasini tanlang.','You are not allowed to do that.'=>'Buni amalga oshirishga ruxsatingiz yo\'q.','Unlimited agents, with a Support agent role that sees only chats and tickets'=>'Cheklanmagan agentlar, faqat chatlar va tishlarni ko‘radigan Qo‘llab-quvvatlash agenti roli bilan','Reply to tickets by email'=>'Elektron pochta orqali cheklarga javob berish','Knowledge base: articles, categories, search, and a KB section in the chat'=>'Bilimlar bazasi: maqolalar, toifalar, qidiruv va chatdagi KB bo\'limi','Saved replies, business hours, priorities and SLAs'=>'Saqlangan javoblar, ish vaqti, ustuvorliklar va SLA\'lar','Suggested replies, thread summaries and auto-tagging by AI'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt tomonidan tavsiya etilgan javoblar, mavzu xulosalari va avtomatik teglar','Knowledge-gap report: the questions your site could not answer'=>'Bilim bo‘shlig‘i to‘g‘risida hisobot: saytingiz javob bera olmagan savollar','Push notifications and an installable agent app for your phone'=>'Telefoningiz uchun push-bildirishnomalar va oʻrnatiladigan agent ilovasi','Proactive messages, reports, webhooks, Slack and Telegram alerts'=>'Faol xabarlar, hisobotlar, veb-huklar, Slack va Telegram ogohlantirishlari','Zinn® Chat Pro'=>'Zinn® Chat Pro','From $%1$d a month or $%2$d a year for one site.'=>'Bitta sayt uchun oyiga $%1$d yoki yiliga $%2$d dan boshlab.','Try Pro free for 14 days'=>'Pro\'ni 14 kun davomida bepul sinab ko\'ring','See plans'=>'Rejalarni ko‘rish','No card needed for the trial.'=>'Sinov muddati uchun karta talab qilinmaydi.','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'ChatGPT yaratuvchilari. Yaxshi universal yordamchi.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Claude yaratuvchilari. Yozish va sinchkovlik bilan fikr yuritishda kuchli.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Google ning Gemini modellari. Tez va arzon.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Tez va arzon modellarga ega Yevropa sun\'iy intellekt kompaniyasi.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Matn yozish va dasturlashda yaxshi bo\'lgan arzon modellar.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Ko\'plab turli provayderlardagi modellar uchun bitta kalit.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'OpenAI API kabi ishlaydigan har qanday xizmat, shu jumladan o\'z kompyuteringiz yoki serveringizda ishlaydigan model.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Umumiy (aniqroq narsa belgilanmaganda ishlatiladi)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Yozish va qayta yozish','Translation'=>'Tarjima','Code and CSS'=>'Kod va CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Kechirasiz, ushbu sahifaga kirishga ruxsatingiz yo\'q.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Ushbu sozlamalar ulardan foydalanadigan har bir plagin tomonidan bo\'lishiladi: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Kalitlaringiz ushbu sayt maʼlumotlar bazasida shifrlangan va faqat siz tanlagan provayderga yuboriladi — hech qachon bizga emas.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'1-qadam (2 tadan): AI provayderini tanlang','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Siz oʻz kalitingizdan foydalanasiz, shuning uchun ishlatganingiz uchun toʻlovni toʻgʻridan-toʻgʻri provayderga amalga oshirasiz. Ishonchingiz komil emasmi? Bularning har biri yaxshi ishlaydi; keyinchalik yana qoʻshishingiz mumkin.','Next'=>'Keyingi','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'2-qadam: %s ulanmoqda','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'OpenAI-mos keluvchi xizmatingiz manzilini oxirida /v1 bilan kiriting. Kalit faqat xizmat uni so\'ragan taqdirdagina kerak bo\'ladi.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'%s ni oching va tizimga kiring (yoki bepul hisob yarating).','the %s API keys page'=>'%s API kalitlari sahifasi','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Yangi kalit yarating va uni nusxalang.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Uni pastga joylashtiring va "Saqlash va sinovdan o\'tkazish" tugmasini bosing. Uning ishlashini tekshirish uchun bitta kichik so\'rov yuboramiz.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Ko\'pgina provayderlar kalit ishlashi uchun hisobda ozgina mablag\' talab qiladi: %s.','add credit'=>'hisobni to\'ldirish','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Boshqa provayderni tanlang','Address'=>'Manzil','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Saqlangan kalit …%s bilan tugaydi — uning o\'rniga yangisini qo\'ying','Key (optional)'=>'Kalit (ixtiyoriy)','API key'=>'API kaliti','Save and test'=>'Saqlash va sinovdan o\'tkazish','Providers'=>'Provayderlar','Provider'=>'Provayder','Status'=>'Holat','Key'=>'Kalit','Get a key'=>'Kalit olish','Test'=>'Sinov','Remove'=>'Oʻchirish','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Yangiroq plagin versiyasi tomonidan saqlangan: ushbu plaginni yangilang yoki kalitni qaytadan kiriting.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Saqlangan kalitni endi ochib bo\'lmaydi (saytning xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni qayta kiriting.','Not connected'=>'Ulanmagan','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ulandi — oxirgi sinovdan o‘tdi %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Oxirgi sinov muvaffaqiyatsiz tugadi: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ulangan — hali sinovdan o‘tkazilmagan','Which model to use'=>'Qaysi modeldan foydalanish kerak','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ bu vazifa uchun tavsiyamizni bildiradi. Ro\'yxat kalitingiz foydalanishi mumkin bo\'lgan har bir modelni o\'z ichiga oladi va provayderdagi ma\'lumotlar real vaqt rejimida o\'qiladi.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Provayder uchun tavsiya etiladi —','Save models'=>'Modellarni saqlash','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Ta\'minotchilardan model ro\'yxatlarini yangilash','Images'=>'Rasmlar','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Tasvirlar yaratish uchun OpenAI yoki Google Gemini\'ni ulang.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Birinchi ulangan provayderning eng yangi tasvir modeli —','Site search (embeddings)'=>'Saytda qidirish (embaddinglar)','Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter to build a search index of your site.'=>'Saytingizning qidiruv indeksini yaratish uchun Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki OpenRouter\'ni ulang.','— The newest embedding model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Birinchi ulangan provayderning eng yangi embedding modeli —','Changing this rebuilds the search index of every plugin that uses it.'=>'Buni o\'zgartirish undan foydalanadigan har bir plaginning qidiruv indeksini qayta tiklaydi.','best quality'=>'eng yaxshi sifat','lowest cost'=>'eng arzon','fastest'=>'eng tez','Add a model yourself'=>'O\'zingiz model qo\'shing','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Bugun yangi model chiqdimi? Uni darhol ishlatish uchun uning aniq nomini kiriting.','Model name'=>'Model nomi','Add model'=>'Model qo\'shish','Recommended models list'=>'Tavsi etilgan modellar ro\'yxati','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Tavsiya etilgan modellar roʻyxatini tekshirib boʻlmadi, shuning uchun hech qanday tavsiya koʻrsatilmagan. Plaginni qayta oʻrnating yoki quyida kundalik yangilanishlarni yoqing.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Foydalanilayotgan roʻyxat %s da eʼlon qilingan. Har bir plagin yangilanishi yangisini olib keladi.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Yangilangan ro‘yxat uchun Zinn Digital® saytini kuniga bir marta tekshirib turing.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Faqat oddiy yuklab olish soʻrovi yuboriladi: kalit ham, sayt manzili ham, kontentingiz haqida hech qanday maʼlumot ham yoʻq. Roʻyxat imzolanadi va imzo tekshiruvidan oʻta olmagan roʻyxat eʼtiborga olinmaydi.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Oxirgi marta tekshirilgan vaqt %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Saqlang va agar yoqilgan bo\'lsa, hoziroq tekshiring','a newer list was installed'=>'yangiroq roʻyxat oʻrnatildi','already up to date'=>'allaqachon yangilangan','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'yuklab olish imzo tekshiruvidan o\'tmadi va e\'tiborsiz qoldirildi','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi; joriy ro‘yxat ishlatishda davom etadi','turned off'=>'o‘chirilgan','Open'=>'Ochish','Check their status page'=>'Ularning holat sahifasini tekshiring','Open your billing page'=>'Hisob-kitob sahifangizni oching','Open your API keys page'=>'API kalitlari sahifasini oching','Open the AI settings'=>'AI sozlamalarini ochish','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Kechirasiz, buni qilishga ruxsatingiz yo\'q.','Unknown provider.'=>'Noma\'lum provayder.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Xizmatingiz manzilini kiriting, masalan, http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Bu API kalitiga o\'xshamaydi. Uni yana bo\'shliqlarsiz nusxalab oling.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Avval API kalitingizni qo\'ying.','Key removed.'=>'Kalit olib tashlandi.','Models saved.'=>'Modellar saqlandi.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Modelning aniq nomini kiriting, masalan, provayder hujjatlarida yozilganidek.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'%s qoʻshildi. Uni "Qaysi modeldan foydalanish" ostidan tanlang.','Model removed.'=>'Model olib tashlandi.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Kundalik yangilanishlar o‘chirilgan. Plagin bilan birga kelgan ro‘yxat ishlatilmoqda.','Checked: %s.'=>'Tekshirildi: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Model roʻyxatlari yangilandi.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Sizning AI kalitingiz plaginlaringizdan birining yangiroq versiyasi tomonidan saqlangan. Ushbu plaginni yangilang yoki AI sozlamalarida kalitni qaytadan kiriting.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Saqlangan sun\'iy intellekt kalitingizni endi ochib bo\'lmaydi (sayt xavfsizlik kalitlari o\'zgargan). Uni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida qaytadan kiriting.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt hali sozlangan emas. AI sozlamalarida sun\'iy intellekt provayderi uchun kalit qo\'shing.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Bu vazifa uchun model tanlanmagan. AI sozlamalaridan birini tanlang.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Ushbu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi plaginning ushbu versiyasi tomonidan qo\'llab-quvvatlanmaydi.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Tasvir yaratish imkoniyatiga ega sun\'iy intellekt provayderi ulanmagan. Sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida OpenAI yoki Google Gemini kalitini qo\'shing.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Bu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi rasm yarata olmaydi. AI sozlamalarida rasmlar uchun OpenAI yoki Google Gemini\'ni tanlang.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Sizning sun\'iy intellekt kalitingiz hech qanday tasvir modelidan foydalana olmaydi. Provayder bilan kalit ruxsatlarini tekshiring yoki tasvirlar uchun boshqa provayderni tanlang.','No connected AI provider can build a search index. Add a Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or OpenRouter key in the AI settings.'=>'U ulangan sun’iy intellekt provayderi qidiruv indeksini yarata olmaydi. AI sozlamalarida Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki OpenRouter kalitini qo‘shing.','Your AI key cannot use any embedding model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for site search.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt kalitingiz hech qanday matnni vektorlashtirish (embedding) modelidan foydalana olmaydi. Provayderda kalit ruxsatlarini tekshiring yoki saytda qidirish uchun boshqa provayderni tanlang.','This AI provider cannot build a search index. Connect Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral or a compatible service for site search.'=>'Bu sun\'iy intellekt provayderi qidiruv indeksini yarata olmaydi. Saytda qidiruv uchun Google Gemini, OpenAI, Mistral yoki mos keluvchi xizmatni ulang.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Ushbu sayt sun\'iy intellekt xizmatingizga ulanolmadi. U ishlayotganini va uning manziliga veb-serveringizdan ulanish mumkinligini tekshiring (shaxsiy kompyuteringizdagi xizmatga hostingdagi saytdan ulanib bo\'lmaydi).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Bu sayt %s manziliga ulanib bo‘lmadi. Ularning holat sahifasini tekshiring; agar ular ishlayotgan bo‘lsa, xostingiz chiquvchi ulanishlarni bloklayotgan bo‘lishi mumkin yoki manzil noto‘g‘ri.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s hisobingizda mablag‘ yoki kvota qolmaganini bildiradi. Ularning hisobingizdagi mablag‘ni to‘ldiring yoki limiti oshiring, so‘ngra qaytadan urinib ko‘ring.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s kalitingizni qabul qilmadi. U xato kiritilgan, bekor qilingan yoki muddati tugagan boʻlishi mumkin. Yangi kalit yarating va uni shu yerga qoʻying.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s kalitingiz uchun ushbu soʻrovni rad etdi. Kalit bu model yoki funksiyaga kirish huquqiga ega boʻlmasligi mumkin yoki hisobingizni tasdiqlash kerak.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Sizning kalitingiz uchun "%1$s" modeli %2$s tomonidan taqdim etilmaydi. Sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalaridan boshqa modelni tanlang.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Sizning %2$s rejangiz "%1$s" modelini o\'z ichiga olmaydi. AI sozlamalarida boshqa modelni tanlang yoki rejangizni ular bilan yangilang.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s kalitingiz soʻrovlarni yuborish tezligini cheklamoqda. Bir daqiqa kutib, qaytadan urinib koʻring yoki ular bilan limitni oshiring.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s ayni paytda muammolarga duch kelmoqda (ularning tomonida nosozlik yoki ortiqcha yuklanish). Sozlamalaringizda hech qanday muammo yo\'q. Qisqa vaqtdan keyin yana urinib ko\'ring.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovi biz aniqlay olmagan sababga ko\'ra bajarilmadi. Qaytadan urinib ko\'ring; agar bu holat takrorlanaversa, quyidagi tafsilotlar bilan qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'SUN\'iy intellekt provayderi ushbu plagin o\'qiy olmaydigan shaklda javob berdi. Qayta urinib ko\'ring; agar bu holat takrorlanaversa, boshqa modelni tanlang yoki yordam xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maxsus (OpenAI bilan mos keluvchi)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Avval ushbu provayder uchun kalitni saqlang.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Kalitingiz ishlayapti, ammo provayder uning uchun matn modelini ko\'rsatmagan. Quyida o\'zingiz model qo\'shing.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ulangan. %1$s %2$s yordamida javob berdi. Sun\'iy intellekt funksiyalaringiz foydalanishga tayyor.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Sizning foydalanuvchi rolingizga ushbu saytda sun\'iy intellektdan foydalanishga ruxsat etilmagan. Administratorga murojaat qiling.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Bu sayt oylik sun\'iy intellekt xarajatlari limitiga yetdi. Administrator buni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida oshirishi mumkin.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Bu sayt sun\'iy intellekt so\'rovlarining oylik limitiga yetdi. Administrator buni sun\'iy intellekt sozlamalarida oshirishi mumkin.','Usage and cost'=>'Foydalanish va narx','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Журнал, лимитлар ва роллар учун рухсатлар қуйидагилар орқали фойдаланиладиган сунъий интеллектга нисбатан қўлланади: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Xarajatlar taxminiy bo‘lib, e’lon qilingan narxlar asosida hisoblangan; narxi noma’lum bo‘lgan model nolga teng deb olinadi.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Shu oy: %1$s ta soʻrov, taxminan %2$s.','When'=>'Qachon','Who'=>'Kim','Used for'=>'Quyidagilar uchun ishlatiladi','Model'=>'Model','Tokens in / out'=>'Kirish / chiqish tokenlari','About'=>'Haqida','Result'=>'Natija','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hali suniy intellekt so\'rovlari amalga oshirilmadi.','Done'=>'Bajarildi','Limits and permissions'=>'Chegaralar va ruxsatlar','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Oylik xarajat limiti (US dollari)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Cheklash qo\'ymaslik uchun bo\'sh qoldiring. Taxminiy xarajat unga yetgandan so\'ng, sun\'iy intellekt oyning qolgan qismi uchun to\'xtaydi.','Monthly request limit'=>'Oylik soʻrovlar limiti','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Cheklov qo\'ymaslik uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Who may use AI'=>'Sun\'iy intellektdan kimlar foydalanishi mumkin','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Plagin funksiyalaridan foydalana oladigan har bir kishi sun\'iy intellektni ishlatishiga ruxsat berish uchun hech birini belimang. Administratorlar undan doimo foydalanishi mumkin.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Cheklovlar va ruxsatlarni saqlash','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Chegaralar va ruxsatlar saqlandi.','Content'=>'Kontent','Not found.'=>'Topilmadi.','%s joined the chat.'=>'%s chatga qo\'shildi.','Type a reply first.'=>'Avval javob yozing.','The chat has ended. Thank you for contacting us.'=>'Suhbat yakunlandi. Biz bilan bog\'langaningiz uchun tashakkur.','You are chatting with the assistant again.'=>'Siz yana yordamchi bilan suhbatlashmoqdasiz.','This conversation is now ticket #%d. We will reply by email.'=>'Ushbu suhbat endi #%d-raqamli murojaatga aylantirildi. Biz elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz.','Type a question first.'=>'Avval savol kiriting.','The whole site is being read again in the background.'=>'Sayt to\'liq ravishda fonda qayta o\'qilmoqda.','Meanings are being rebuilt in the background.'=>'Ma\'nolar fonda qayta tiklanmoqda.','Submit a ticket form'=>'Murojaat yuborish shakli','Heading'=>'Sarlavha','Default subject'=>'Standart mavzu','Button text'=>'Tugma matni','Show the subject field (yes or no)'=>'Mavzu maydonini ko\'rsatish (ha yoki yo\'q)','My support requests'=>'Mening qo\'llab-quvvatlash so\'rovlarim','Chat button'=>'Chat tugmasi','Chat with us'=>'Biz bilan chat orqali bog\'laning','Support'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d. We have emailed you a link to follow it.'=>'Rahmat. Sizning so\'rovingiz #%d-raqamli tirket hisoblanadi. Uni kuzatib borishingiz uchun elektron pochtangizga havola yubordik.','Your reply has been sent.'=>'Javobingiz yuborildi.','If there is a request under that address, we have emailed you a new link.'=>'Agar bu manzil bo\'yicha so\'rov mavjud bo\'lsa, biz sizga yangi havolani elektron pochta orqali yubordik.','Something went wrong. Please check the form and try again.'=>'Nimadir xato ketdi. Iltimos, shaklni tekshiring va qaytadan urinib ko\'ring.','Your message could not be sent.'=>'Xabaringiz yuborilmadi.','You are sending messages too quickly. Please wait a little and try again.'=>'Siz juda tez-tez xabar yuboryapsiz. Iltimos, biroz kuting va qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Please agree to the privacy notice to send your request.'=>'So\'rovingizni yuborish uchun maxfiylik bildirnomasiga rozilik bildiring.','Please complete the check to show you are not a robot.'=>'Robot emasligingizni tasdiqlash uchun tekshiruvdan o\'ting.','Sign in to see your support requests.'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash so\'rovlaringizni ko\'rish uchun tizimga kiring.','Your name'=>'Sizning ismingiz','Your email'=>'Sizning elektron pochtangiz','Subject'=>'Mavzu','Which order is this about?'=>'Bu qaysi buyurtmaga tegishli?','Not about an order'=>'Buyurtma haqida emas','How can we help?'=>'Sizga qanday yordam bera olamiz?','Privacy policy'=>'Maxfiylik siyosati','Send request'=>'So\'rov yuborish','All requests'=>'Barcha soʻrovlar','Your support requests'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash so\'rovlaringiz','You have no support requests yet.'=>'Sizda hali yordam so\'rovlari yo\'q.','Updated'=>'Yangilangan','New request'=>'Yangi so‘rov','This link has expired. Enter your email address and we will send you a new one.'=>'Bu havola muddati o\'tgan. Elektron pochta manzilingizni kiriting va biz sizga yangisini yuboramiz.','This link is not valid. Enter your email address and we will send you a link to your requests.'=>'Bu havola yaroqli emas. Elektron pochta manzilingizni kiriting va biz sizga soʻrovlaringiz havolasini yuboramiz.','Email me a new link'=>'Menga yangi havola yuboring','Request #%1$d: %2$s'=>'%1$d-sonli soʻrov: %2$s','Status:'=>'Holat:','Your reply'=>'Sizning javobingiz','Send reply'=>'Javob yuborish','You'=>'Siz','Submit a ticket'=>'Ariza yuborish','Add to Menu'=>'Menuga qo\'shish','Create the support page on the Zinn® Chat setup screen to add a "Submit a ticket" link.'=>'Zinn® Chat o\'rnatish ekranida "Submit a ticket" havolasini qo\'shish uchun qo\'llab-quvvatlash sahifasini yarating.','[#%1$d] We have your request: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] So\'rovingiz qabul qilindi: %2$s','Thank you for contacting us. We have received your request and will reply as soon as we can.'=>'Biz bilan bog\'langaningiz uchun tashakkur. So\'rovingiz qabul qilindi va imkon qadar tezroq javob beramiz.','View your request'=>'So‘rovingizni ko‘rish','[#%1$d] New ticket: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Yangi so\'rov: %2$s','Open the ticket'=>'Murojaatni ochish','[#%1$d] New reply: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Yangi javob: %2$s','You can reply on the page below.'=>'Quyidagi sahifada javob berishingiz mumkin.','View and reply'=>'Ko\'rish va javob berish','[#%1$d] Customer replied: %2$s'=>'[#%1$d] Mijoz javob berdi: %2$s','A visitor is waiting in chat #%d'=>'Mehmon #%d chatda kutmoqda','A visitor asked to talk to a person and is waiting for an answer.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchi odam bilan gaplashishni so\'radi va javob kutmoqda.','Answer now'=>'Hozir javob bering','Your chat with %s'=>'%s bilan suhbatingiz','[#%d] Your link to your request'=>'[#%d] So\'rovingizga havola','Here is a new link to your request. The old one no longer works.'=>'So\'rovingiz uchun yangi havola mana shu. Eskisi endi ishlamaydi.','From: %s'=>'Kimdan: %s','a visitor'=>'tashrif buyuruvchi','Zinn® Chat chats and support tickets'=>'Zinn® Chat chatlari va qo\'llab-quvvatlash chiptalari','Chats'=>'Chatlar','Started'=>'Ishga tushirilgan','Name'=>'Nomi','Email'=>'Elektron pochta','Page'=>'Sahifa','Messages'=>'Xabarlar','Support tickets'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash chiptalari','Ticket'=>'Murojaat','Opened'=>'Ochilgan','When you use the chat or submit a support request, we store your messages, the name and email address you give us, the page you were on and a coded form of your IP address, so that we can answer you and keep a record of your request.'=>'Siz chatdan foydalanganingizda yoki qo\'llab-quvvatlash so\'rovini yuborganingizda, savolingizga javob berish va so\'rovingiz tarixini saqlab qolish uchun xabarlaringizni, bizga taqdim etgan ismingiz va elektron pochta manzilingizni, qaysi sahifada bo\'lganingizni va IP manzilingizning shifrlangan shaklini saqlaymiz.','If our AI assistant answers you, your message and passages from this website are sent to the AI provider we use to produce the answer.'=>'Agar sun\'iy intellekt yordamchimiz sizga javob bersa, xabaringiz va ushbu veb-saytdagi parchalar javob berish uchun biz foydalanadigan sun\'iy intellekt provayderiga yuboriladi.','The chat is not available right now.'=>'Chat hozirda mavjud emas.','Please type a message.'=>'Iltimos, xabar yozing.','Please agree to the privacy notice to start the chat.'=>'Chatni boshlash uchun maxfiylik bildirishnomasiga rozilik bildiring.','You have started too many chats today. Please try again tomorrow or send us a ticket.'=>'Siz bugun juda ko\'p chat boshladingiz. Iltimos, ertaga qayta urinib ko\'ring yoki bizga bayonnoma yuboring.','The chat could not be started. Please try again.'=>'Chatni boshlab bo‘lmadi. Iltimos, qaytadan urinib ko‘ring.','Nobody can answer in chat right now. Leave your email address and we will reply by email.'=>'Hozirda chatda hech kim javob bera olmaydi. E-pochta manzilingizni qoldiring va biz elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz.','The assistant cannot answer right now. You can ask for a person or leave us a message.'=>'Yordamchi hozircha javob bera olmaydi. Mutaxassis bilan bog\'lanishni so\'rashingiz yoki bizga xabar qoldirishingiz mumkin.','We are putting you through to a person. Please stay on this page.'=>'Biz sizni operatorga ulayapmiz. Iltimos, shu sahizada qoling.','This chat has ended.'=>'Bu chat yakunlandi.','Tickets are not available right now.'=>'Hozirda chiptalar mavjud emas.','Visitor'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchi','Team'=>'Jamoa','Chat so far:'=>'Hozircha suhbat:','Thank you. Your request is ticket #%d and we will reply by email.'=>'Rahmat. Sizning so‘rovingiz #%d-raqamli tiket sifatida qabul qilindi va biz elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz.','Please enter a valid email address.'=>'Iltimos, yaroqli elektron pochta manzilini kiriting.','This link is not valid.'=>'Bu havola yaroqli emas.','This link has expired. We can email you a new one.'=>'Bu havola muddati o\'tgan. Sizga yangisini elektron pochta orqali yuborishimiz mumkin.','You cannot see this ticket.'=>'Siz bu arizani ko\'ra olmaysiz.','Hi! Ask me anything about this site. I answer from its own pages, and I can put you through to a person.'=>'Salom! Bu sayt haqida istalgan narsani so\'rang. Men uning o\'z sahifalaridan javob beraman va sizni mutaxassisga bog\'lay olaman.','Hi! How can we help? Send us a message and we will get back to you.'=>'Salom! Sizga qanday yordam bera olamiz? Bizga xabar yuboring, biz siz bilan tez orada bog\'lanamiz.','Nobody is online right now. Leave your question and email address and we will reply by email.'=>'Hozirda hech kim onlayn emas. Savolingiz va elektron pochta manzilingizni qoldiring, biz elektron pochta orqali javob beramiz.','We keep this conversation so we can answer you.'=>'Sizga javob bera olishimiz uchun ushbu suhbatni saqlab qolamiz.','Please enter a valid email address so we can reply.'=>'Iltimos, javob berishimiz uchun yaroqli elektron pochta manzilini kiriting.','Please describe what you need help with.'=>'Iltimos, nima bo\'yicha yordam kerakligini tasvirlang.','The ticket could not be saved. Please try again.'=>'Murojaatni saqlab bo\'lmadi. Iltimos, qaytadan urinib ko\'ring.','That ticket does not exist.'=>'Bunday so‘rov mavjud emas.','The reply is empty.'=>'Javob bo\'sh.','Waiting for customer'=>'Mijozni kutish','Solved'=>'Hal qilingan','Closed'=>'Yopilgan','Open chat'=>'Chatni ochish','I agree'=>'Men roziman','Type your message…'=>'Xabaringizni yozing…','Send'=>'Yuborish','Close chat'=>'Chatni yopish','Minimise'=>'Kichraytirish','Talk to a person'=>'Mutaxassis bilan bog‘lanish','Leave a message'=>'Xabar qoldirish','Your message'=>'Sizning xabaringiz','Send message'=>'Xabar yuborish','Cancel'=>'Bekor qilish','Support team'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlash jamoasi','is typing…'=>'yozyapti…','Looking this up…'=>'Qidirilmoqda…','Sources'=>'Manbalar','Was this helpful?'=>'Bu yordam berdimi?','Yes'=>'Ha','No'=>'Yo\'q','Thank you for your feedback.'=>'Fikringiz uchun tashakkur.','Email me this chat'=>'Ushbu chatni menga elektron pochta orqali yuboring','Sent.'=>'Yuborildi.','End chat'=>'Chatni tugatish','The chat has ended.'=>'Chat yakunlandi.','Something went wrong. Please try again.'=>'Xatolik yuz berdi. Iltimos, qaytadan urinib ko\'ring.','Powered by Zinn® Chat'=>'Zinn® Chat tomonidan taqdim etilgan','Start a new chat'=>'Yangi chat boshlash','Get help with this order'=>'Ushbu buyurtma bo‘yicha yordam olish','Order #%1$s (%2$s)'=>'Buyurtma #%1$s (%2$s)','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qo‘llanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasini o\'qing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® hosting','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'