 agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Litsenziya bilan hali foydalanuvchi bog\'lanmagan, bu ruxsatsiz faollashtirishning oldini olish uchun zarur. Litsenziyani foydalanuvchingizga biriktirish orqali siz WordPress foydalanuvchingizning to\'liq ismi va elektron pochta manzilini ulashishga rozilik bildirasiz.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'yuqorida tilga olingan saytlar','Account'=>'Hisob','Account Details'=>'Hisob ma\'lumotlari','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Hisob faollashtirilishini kutmoqda. Hisobingizni faollashtirish uchun emailingizni tekshiring va havolani bosing, shundan so‘ng hamkorlik formasini qaytadan yuboring.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'%1$s ni %2$s bilan birlashtirmoqchimisiz?','Actions'=>'Amallar','Activate'=>'Faollashtirish','Activate Free Version'=>'Bepul versiyani faollashtirish','Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani faollashtirish','activate a license here'=>'bu yerda litsenziyani faollashtirish','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Iltimos, xarid qilganingizdan so\'ng darhol elektron pochtangizga kelgan litsenziya kalitini kiriting:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarda litsenziyani faollashtirish.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'%1$s ning pullik versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan. %2$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun uni faollashtiring. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'%1$s ning pullik versiyasi allaqachon o\'rnatilgan. Uni faollashtirish hamda %3$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishni boshlash uchun %2$s sahifasiga o\'ting.','Activate this add-on'=>'Ushbu qo‘shimchani faollashtirish','Activate %s'=>'%s ni faollashtirish','Activate %s features'=>'%s funksiyalarini faollashtirish','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'"%s" faollashtirishni hoziroq yakunlash','Activate %s Plan'=>'%s rejasini faollashtirish','Activated'=>'Faollashtirilgan','Activating'=>'Faollashtirilmoqda','Activating license'=>'Litsenziya faollashtirilmoqda','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Hisobingiz %s rejasi bilan muvaffaqiyatli faollashtirildi.','active add-onActive'=>'Faol','Add another domain'=>'Boshqa domen qo\'shish','Add-Ons'=>'Qoʻshimchalar','Add Ons for %s'=>'%s uchun qo‘shimchalar','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Qo‘shimchalar ro‘yxatini yuklab bo‘lmadi. Bu ehtimol bizning tomondan yuzaga kelgan muammo, iltimos, bir necha daqiqadan so‘ng qayta urinib ko‘ring.','Add-On'=>'Qoʻshimcha','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s faqat premium qoʻshimcha hisoblanadi. Plaginni faollashtirishdan oldin avval litsenziya sotib olishingiz kerak.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'%s qo\'shimchasi muvaffaqiyatli sotib olindi.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Sizning %s qo\'shimcha rejangiz muvaffaqiyatli yangilandi.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'%s bepul sinov muddati muvaffaqiyatli bekor qilindi. Qo\'shimcha faqat premium bo\'lgani sababli u avtomatik ravishda o\'chirib qo\'yildi. Agar kelajakda undan foydalanishni istasangiz, litsenziya sotib olishingiz kerak bo\'ladi.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s plginsiz ishlay olmaydi.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s siz ishlay olmaydi.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Faqatgina %s ning qo‘shimcha imkoniyatlari haqidagi ma’lumot tashqi serverdan olinayotgani haqida sizni xabardor qilmoqchimiz.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'%s modulining qo\'shimchalari','Address Line %d'=>'Manzil qatori %d','Affiliate'=>'Hamkor','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Hamkorlik shartlarimiz buzilganligi sababli, hamkorlik hisobingizni vaqtincha bloklashga qaror qildik. Agar savollaringiz bo\'lsa, qo\'llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qiling.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Sizning sheriklik hisobingiz vaqtincha to\'xtatib turildi.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'%1$s bo\'yicha hamkorlik arizangiz qabul qilindi! Hamkorlik bo\'limiga kiring: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Hamkorlik dasturimizga topshirgan arizangiz uchun tashakkur, afsuski, bu safar arizangizni rad etishga qaror qildik. Iltimos, 30 kundan keyin qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Sheriklik dasturimizga ariza topshirganingiz uchun tashakkur, ma\'lumotlaringizni keyingi 14 kun ichida ko\'rib chiqamiz va qo\'shimcha ma\'lumot bilan siz bilan bog\'lanamiz.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'Daromad salohiyatini oshirish uchun birinchi tashrifdan keyin %s kuziruv kuqisi.','Affiliation'=>'Hamkorlik','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagandan so\'ng siz Free versiyasidan foydalanishda davom etishingiz mumkin, ammo %s funksiyalaridan foydalana olmaysiz.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Litsenziyangiz muddati tugagandan so\'ng, uni yaroqli premium litsenziya bilan qayta faollashtirmaguningizcha, %s dan foydalana olmaysiz.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Siz hali ham barcha %1$s funksiyalaridan foydalanishingiz mumkin, lekin %2$s xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlariga hamda yordamga ega boʻlmaysiz.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Yangilaganingiz uchun rahmat.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Bepul %1$s davridan keyin %2$s dan boshlab toʻlang','Agree & Activate License'=>'Litsenziyani qabul qilish va faollashtirish','I Agree - Change User'=>'Roziman - Foydalanuvchini o\'zgartirish','All Requests'=>'Barcha so‘rovlar','All Types'=>'Barcha turlar','allow'=>'ruxsat berish','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Siz allaqachon %s ni yaxshilashga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatishimizga rozi bo‘lgansiz.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Siz allaqachon ularni yanada yaxshilashimizga yordam beradigan foydalanishni kuzatib borishimizga rozilik bergansiz.','Amount'=>'Miqdor','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Yillik','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Yillik','Anonymous feedback'=>'Anonim fikr-mulohaza','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Tarmoqdagi barcha saytlarga qo\'llash.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Barcha kutilayotgan saytlarga nisbat qo\'llash.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Hamkor bo\'lish uchun ariza topshiring','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Tasdiqlash va sinov muddatini boshlash','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=