license.'=>'Mijoz yangi litsenziya sotib olganda %s komissiya.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Biz 30 kunlik muddatni ehtimoliy pul qaytarishlar uchun saqlab qolganimiz sababli, biz faqat 30 kundan oshgan komissiya to‘lovlarini amalga oshiramiz.','Communication'=>'Aloqa','Compatible up to'=>'Muvofiqligi: maks.','complete the opt-in'=>'obunani yakunlash','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Tabriklaymiz','Never miss an important update'=>'Muhim yangilanishni hech qachon o\'tkazib yubormang','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'%1$s v%2$s versiyasiga yangilaganingiz uchun tashakkur!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, oʻquv materiallari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar boʻyicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti maʼlumotlarini ulashish uchun roʻyxatdan oʻting. Bu bizga %s ni saytingizga mosroq qilishga va sizga kerakli vazifalarni yanada yaxshiroq bajarishiga yordam beradi.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlari, o‘quv qo‘llanmalari va vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar bo‘yicha elektron pochta xabarnomalarini olish hamda asosiy WordPress muhiti haqida ayrim ma’lumotlarni ulashish uchun rozilik bildiring.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Buni o\'tkazib yuborsangiz ham bo\'ladi! %1$s baribir yaxshi ishlayveradi.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Muhim yangilanishni o‘tkazib yubormasligingiz va %s ni saytingizga moslashuvchanroq hamda ehtiyojlaringizni bajarishda samaraliroq qilishimizga yordam berishingiz uchun biz ushbu ixtiyoriy funksiyani joriy qildik.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Biz Freemius tarmoq darajasidagi integratsiyani taqdim etishdan mamnunmiz.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida tarmoqda hali e\'tiboringizni talab qiladigan %s ta sayt aniqlandi.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Yangilash jarayonida litsenziyasi faollashtirilishi kutilayotgan %d ta sayt aniqlandi.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Agar ushbu saytlarda %s dan foydalanishni istasangiz, iltimos, litsenziya kalitingizni quyiga kiriting va faollashtirish tugmasini bosing.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Shuningdek, buni hozircha o‘tkazib yuborib, litsenziyani keyinroq %s tarmog‘i darajasidagi Hisob qaydnomasi sahifasida faollashtirishingiz mumkin.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Ulandi','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Ishni tugatganingizdan so\'ng, %s ni o\'chiring va uni qaytadan faollashtiring.','Contact'=>'Aloqa','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksional yangilanishlar, ta\'limiy kontent hamda vaqti-vaqti bilan taqdim etiladigan takliflar yuzasidan siz bilan bog\'lanishimizni xohlasangiz, bizga xabar bering:','Contact Support'=>'Qo‘llab-quvvatlash xizmatiga murojaat qilish','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Noqulaylik uchun uzr so\'raymiz va agar bizga imko