yoki faol emasligi','New Version Available'=>'Yangi versiya mavjud','Optional'=>'Ixtiyoriy','Plan'=>'Tarif режаси','Products'=>'Mahsulotlar','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Diagnostika ma\'lumotlarini ulash veb-saytingizga mos keladigan qo\'shimcha funksionallikni taqdim etishga, veb-sayt ishdan chiqishiga olib kelishi mumkin bo\'lgan WordPress yoki PHP versiyalarining mos kelmasligining oldini olishga hamda %s qaysi tillar va mintaqalarga tarjima qilinishi va moslashtirilishi kerakligini aniqlashga yordam beradi.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Shuning uchun %s faol bo\'lmaganda litsenziyani qayta ishlatishingiz mumkin.','Subscription'=>'Obuna','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'Xavfsizlik va funksiya yangilanishlarini tekshirish hamda litsenziyangiz haqiqiyligini tasdiqlash uchun %1$s vaqti-vaqti bilan muhim litsenziya ma\'lumotlarini %2$sga yuborib turadi.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'%1$s dan %2$s mavjud.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'O‘rnatilgan plaginlar va themelar bilan moslikni ta’minlash hamda ziddiyatlarning oldini olish uchun.','Trial'=>'Sinov muddati','View %s State'=>'%s holatini koʻrish','View Basic %s Info'=>'Asosiy %s maʼlumotlarini koʻrish','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ha, %2$s sinov, bosqichma-bosqich yoki dasturlash maqsadlari uchun %4$s nusxasidir.','You have a %s license.'=>'Sizda %s litsenziya mavjud.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Siz %s litsenziyasini sotib oldingiz.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to yo